{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_5001_p", "source_sha256": "f33d19d6774096ddd7cc219fc323f5bc62a2d23f39ef01748c51e475acf47e3f", "ja": "（美術をテーマにしたイベントで、海美がモデルを\nする事に！　でも、なんだか落ち着かない様子だ……）", "zh": "（在一场以美术为主题的活动中，海美要担任模特！不过，她好像总也静不下来……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_5002_029umi", "source_sha256": "873157cd93776f0aeca265b20951ab78c9a36afdf8c5c77dfa17d7ae51e12fa8", "ja": "うーっ……緊張するよー！\n絵のモデルなんて、全然経験ないもん……。", "zh": "呜……好紧张啊——！\n我完全没有当画模特的经验……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_5003_029umi", "source_sha256": "2668de10e3aa19948591d054e2d1a7fd1c6f16c4593b5b490c29bf2d8a60ec52", "ja": "ポーズってどうしたらいいのかな？\nグラビアみたいなポーズはやっぱダメだよね？", "zh": "要摆什么姿势才好呢？\n像写真那样的姿势果然还是不行吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_5004_029umi", "source_sha256": "1daedf128414d33e92262f3e2e1086ccc8f41ac7ef1aa3297abc9991768d3c0a", "ja": "{$P$}、お願いっ！\nみんなが喜んでくれるポーズ、一緒に考えて～！", "zh": "{$P$}，拜托啦！\n一起想个能让大家开心的姿势吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_5005_p", "source_sha256": "8d7993f07458a81d7b849e79e14ba6f8fabd0ff82a9328e3b595ef2b4f4c87a4", "ja": "うーん、みんなが喜んでくれるポーズか。\nだったら……。", "zh": "嗯……能让大家开心的姿势啊。既然这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_5006", "source_sha256": "cad6e9839075bef0ac4b6e44582c6a6b2c572d2cdcd50979984e268f77871b4e", "ja": "可愛いポーズ！", "zh": "可爱的姿势！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_5007", "source_sha256": "2b9616ad328ec7901b64b996249f1dea4b8d86ae137e71a3297090cd9eb3b9ba", "ja": "高難易度のポーズ！", "zh": "高难度姿势！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_5200_p", "source_sha256": "59e35f73f6432bef9de58992d3463ecee63c58b5b7418b44a319f3ff35ccb5d6", "ja": "せっかく可愛い衣装だから、\nそれに合わせたポーズにするのがいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "难得穿了这么可爱的服装，\n配合衣服来摆姿势不是挺好的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_5201_029umi", "source_sha256": "00f374ac60f056549227c369dacf7665cde54fc265a677cd3de872fd69bff886", "ja": "あっ、そっか！　そうだよね。\nこんなにかわいい制服を用意してくれたんだもん！", "zh": "啊，原来如此！确实应该这样。\n毕竟你特意准备了这么可爱的制服嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_5202_029umi", "source_sha256": "cb33b6d24707b6f80f6657de566080213380114e2876052b6e968fe3a0906a35", "ja": "{$P$}、ありがとっ！\nこの制服に合う、カワイイポーズを考えてみるね♪", "zh": "{$P$}，谢谢你！\n我来想想和这套制服搭配的可爱姿势吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_5300_p", "source_sha256": "59e35f73f6432bef9de58992d3463ecee63c58b5b7418b44a319f3ff35ccb5d6", "ja": "せっかく可愛い衣装だから、\nそれに合わせたポーズにするのがいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "难得穿了这么可爱的服装，\n配合衣服来摆姿势不是挺好的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_5301_029umi", "source_sha256": "44d4c771701590b5ad3f9ab9015d7bbeda496fd3532c5bb8d1dc01ee53ff7f20", "ja": "それなら、ダンスしてる時の決めポーズかな～？\nお客さんいつも、カワイイって言ってくれるし！", "zh": "那样的话，就摆跳舞时的招牌姿势吧～？\n客人们总是会说很可爱呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_5302_029umi", "source_sha256": "af2e751c27d9f68db9423caf26e074e0b0a97fd6983b617b6612265ff6455fe9", "ja": "あっ、でもでも、決めポーズもいっぱいあるよね。\nどれにしよう……もう、全部やっちゃう！？", "zh": "啊，不过招牌姿势也有很多呢。\n选哪个呢……干脆全部来一遍！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_5500_p", "source_sha256": "f050583ee5f5ea4f8df515b5c047a18e3fd2f315e59b2aa4ff8c5c20d9ea0695", "ja": "どうせなら、他のモデルさんに出来ない\n高難易度のポーズに挑んでみないか？", "zh": "既然要做，不如挑战一下其他模特做不到的\n高难度姿势吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_5501_029umi", "source_sha256": "5623d22ec42fc5d32f62393121275f90da8e43b3383a6aafe391736bcee460f3", "ja": "それならバレエのポーズがいいかもっ！\n足をピーンってあげるやつとか、いろいろあるよ。", "zh": "那样的话，芭蕾舞的姿势或许不错！\n比如把腿笔直地抬起来的那种，还有很多其他姿势呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_5502_029umi", "source_sha256": "abe5c822efc0c1a1bcd6feb753f68774a514f716328f01312ca88698aa081fe1", "ja": "うーっ！　なんだか燃えてきた！\n絶対いい絵にしてもらうから、楽しみにしててね☆", "zh": "呜——！不知怎么的，斗志燃起来了！\n我一定会让你画出一幅好画的，敬请期待哦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_5600_p", "source_sha256": "f050583ee5f5ea4f8df515b5c047a18e3fd2f315e59b2aa4ff8c5c20d9ea0695", "ja": "どうせなら、他のモデルさんに出来ない\n高難易度のポーズに挑んでみないか？", "zh": "既然要做，不如挑战一下其他模特做不到的\n高难度姿势吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_5601_029umi", "source_sha256": "3c528fc9664166cb543f9c2757838b89ff3627e4fe7e7a60720bf7250dec8387", "ja": "そっか、じゃあ……ヨガのポーズとかどうかな？\n前、莉緒ねぇに少し教えてもらったんだ～♪", "zh": "这样啊，那……要不要试试瑜伽姿势之类的？\n之前莉绪姐稍微教过我一点～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_5602_029umi", "source_sha256": "9f2c707ca77660322855ea228633a2fcfcbc13c84968f77b209f46c0ad7e2d5a", "ja": "船のポーズとか、めちゃくちゃ腹筋に効くんだ☆\nあっ、苦しそうな顔になっちゃったらどうしよーっ！？", "zh": "船式这个动作，对腹肌超级有效哦☆\n啊，要是做出一脸痛苦的表情怎么办——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
